msgid ""
"Feedly uses AI to decide what's important for you. NewsBlur's intelligence training puts you in control. "
"Thumbs up on an author, tag, or keyword to highlight stories you care about. Thumbs down to hide what you "
"don't. Stories are color-coded green (focus), yellow (neutral), and red (hidden) so you always know why "
"you're seeing something. No black box, no algorithmic surprises."
msgstr ""
"Feedly 使用 AI 判斷哪些內容對你很重要。NewsBlur "
"的智慧訓練功能讓你掌握主導權。對你關心的作者、標籤或關鍵字按讚，醒目標示相關文章；按倒讚則隱藏不想看的內容。文章會以顏色分類：綠色（焦點）、黃色（中立）、紅色（隱藏），讓你隨時知道為什麼會看到某篇文章。沒有黑箱，也沒有演算法帶來的意外。"

